  const FL={
    en:['Sort by Popular','Price: low to high','Price: high to low','Data: high to low','Validity: longest first','Plan smarter. Travel further.','Calculate my travel budget','Choose the right plan for your trip.','Get online abroad in minutes.','Find your country or region.','See data, duration and prices.','Quick and secure payment.','Filters','Narrow plans by provider, region, data, duration and network.','Provider','Region','All regions','Price','Any price','Minimum data','Any data','Validity','Any duration','Network','Any network','Unlimited only','Show plans with unlimited data.','5G only','Show plans that include 5G.','Reset','Apply filters','Scan a code','Scan a QR code or barcode, upload an image, or paste a code.','Ready to scan.','Search','Start camera','Upload image','Paste code, URL or destination'],
