    hi:['लोकप्रियता के अनुसार क्रमबद्ध करें','कीमत: कम से अधिक','कीमत: अधिक से कम','डेटा: अधिक से कम','वैधता: सबसे लंबी पहले','बेहतर योजना बनाएं। आगे यात्रा करें।','यात्रा बजट गणना करें','अपनी यात्रा के लिए सही प्लान चुनें।','विदेश में मिनटों में ऑनलाइन हों।','अपना देश या क्षेत्र खोजें।','डेटा, अवधि और कीमतें देखें।','तेज़ और सुरक्षित भुगतान।','फ़िल्टर','प्रदाता, क्षेत्र, डेटा, अवधि और नेटवर्क से फ़िल्टर करें।','प्रदाता','क्षेत्र','सभी क्षेत्र','कीमत','कोई भी कीमत','न्यूनतम डेटा','कोई भी डेटा','वैधता','कोई भी अवधि','नेटवर्क','कोई भी नेटवर्क','केवल अनलिमिटेड','अनलिमिटेड डेटा वाले प्लान दिखाएं।','केवल 5G','5G वाले प्लान दिखाएं।','रीसेट','फ़िल्टर लागू करें','कोड स्कैन करें','QR/बारकोड स्कैन करें, चित्र अपलोड करें या कोड पेस्ट करें।','स्कैन के लिए तैयार।','खोजें','कैमरा शुरू करें','चित्र अपलोड करें','कोड, URL या गंतव्य पेस्ट करें'],
    id:['Urutkan berdasarkan popularitas','Harga: rendah ke tinggi','Harga: tinggi ke rendah','Data: tinggi ke rendah','Masa berlaku: terlama','Rencanakan lebih cerdas. Jelajah lebih jauh.','Hitung anggaran perjalanan','Pilih paket yang tepat untuk perjalananmu.','Online di luar negeri dalam hitungan menit.','Temukan negara atau wilayahmu.','Lihat data, durasi, dan harga.','Pembayaran cepat dan aman.','Filter','Saring menurut provider, wilayah, data, durasi, dan jaringan.','Provider','Wilayah','Semua wilayah','Harga','Harga apa pun','Data minimum','Data apa pun','Masa berlaku','Durasi apa pun','Jaringan','Jaringan apa pun','Hanya unlimited','Tampilkan paket data unlimited.','Hanya 5G','Tampilkan paket dengan 5G.','Reset','Terapkan filter','Pindai kode','Pindai QR/barcode, unggah gambar, atau tempel kode.','Siap memindai.','Cari','Mulai kamera','Unggah gambar','Tempel kode, URL, atau destinasi'],
    ms:['Susun mengikut populariti','Harga: rendah ke tinggi','Harga: tinggi ke rendah','Data: tinggi ke rendah','Tempoh: terpanjang','Rancang lebih bijak. Pergi lebih jauh.','Kira bajet perjalanan','Pilih pelan yang sesuai untuk perjalanan anda.','Sambung internet di luar negara dalam beberapa minit.','Cari negara atau rantau anda.','Lihat data, tempoh dan harga.','Bayaran pantas dan selamat.','Penapis','Tapis mengikut penyedia, rantau, data, tempoh dan rangkaian.','Penyedia','Rantau','Semua rantau','Harga','Sebarang harga','Data minimum','Sebarang data','Tempoh sah','Sebarang tempoh','Rangkaian','Sebarang rangkaian','Tanpa had sahaja','Tunjukkan pelan data tanpa had.','5G sahaja','Tunjukkan pelan dengan 5G.','Tetapkan semula','Guna penapis','Imbas kod','Imbas QR/kod bar, muat naik imej atau tampal kod.','Sedia untuk mengimbas.','Cari','Mulakan kamera','Muat naik imej','Tampal kod, URL atau destinasi'],
    vi:['Sắp xếp theo phổ biến','Giá: thấp đến cao','Giá: cao đến thấp','Dữ liệu: nhiều đến ít','Thời hạn: dài nhất','Lên kế hoạch thông minh hơn. Đi xa hơn.','Tính ngân sách chuyến đi','Chọn gói phù hợp cho chuyến đi.','Kết nối ở nước ngoài chỉ trong vài phút.','Tìm quốc gia hoặc khu vực.','Xem dữ liệu, thời hạn và giá.','Thanh toán nhanh và an toàn.','Bộ lọc','Lọc theo nhà cung cấp, khu vực, dữ liệu, thời hạn và mạng.','Nhà cung cấp','Khu vực','Tất cả khu vực','Giá','Mọi mức giá','Dữ liệu tối thiểu','Mọi dung lượng','Thời hạn','Mọi thời hạn','Mạng','Mọi mạng','Chỉ không giới hạn','Chỉ hiển thị gói dữ liệu không giới hạn.','Chỉ 5G','Chỉ hiển thị gói có 5G.','Đặt lại','Áp dụng bộ lọc','Quét mã','Quét QR/mã vạch, tải ảnh lên hoặc dán mã.','Sẵn sàng quét.','Tìm kiếm','Bật camera','Tải ảnh lên','Dán mã, URL hoặc điểm đến'],
    he:['מיין לפי פופולריות','מחיר: מהנמוך לגבוה','מחיר: מהגבוה לנמוך','נתונים: מהגבוה לנמוך','תוקף: הארוך ביותר','תכנן חכם יותר. סע רחוק יותר.','חשב תקציב נסיעה','בחר את החבילה הנכונה לנסיעה שלך.','התחבר בחו״ל תוך דקות.','מצא מדינה או אזור.','ראה נתונים, משך ומחירים.','תשלום מהיר ומאובטח.','מסננים','סנן לפי ספק, אזור, נתונים, משך ורשת.','ספק','אזור','כל האזורים','מחיר','כל מחיר','מינימום נתונים','כל כמות נתונים','תוקף','כל משך','רשת','כל רשת','ללא הגבלה בלבד','הצג חבילות עם נתונים ללא הגבלה.','5G בלבד','הצג חבילות עם 5G.','איפוס','החל מסננים','סרוק קוד','סרוק QR/ברקוד, העלה תמונה או הדבק קוד.','מוכן לסריקה.','חיפוש','הפעל מצלמה','העלה תמונה','הדבק קוד, URL או יעד'],
    hr:['Sortiraj po popularnosti','Cijena: niža prema višoj','Cijena: viša prema nižoj','Podaci: više prema manje','Trajanje: najdulje','Planiraj pametnije. Putuj dalje.','Izračunaj budžet putovanja','Odaberi pravi plan za putovanje.','Poveži se u inozemstvu za nekoliko minuta.','Pronađi državu ili regiju.','Vidi podatke, trajanje i cijene.','Brzo i sigurno plaćanje.','Filtri','Filtriraj po pružatelju, regiji, podacima, trajanju i mreži.','Pružatelj','Regija','Sve regije','Cijena','Bilo koja cijena','Minimalno podataka','Bilo koja količina','Trajanje','Bilo koje trajanje','Mreža','Bilo koja mreža','Samo neograničeno','Prikaži planove s neograničenim podacima.','Samo 5G','Prikaži planove s 5G.','Poništi','Primijeni filtre','Skeniraj kod','Skeniraj QR/barkod, prenesi sliku ili zalijepi kod.','Spremno za skeniranje.','Traži','Pokreni kameru','Prenesi sliku','Zalijepi kod, URL ili odredište'],
    bg:['Сортиране по популярност','Цена: ниска към висока','Цена: висока към ниска','Данни: повече към по-малко','Валидност: най-дълга','Планирайте по-умно. Пътувайте по-далеч.','Изчисли бюджета за пътуване','Изберете правилния план за пътуването.','Бъдете онлайн в чужбина за минути.','Намерете държава или регион.','Вижте данни, срок и цени.','Бързо и сигурно плащане.','Филтри','Филтрирайте по доставчик, регион, данни, срок и мрежа.','Доставчик','Регион','Всички региони','Цена','Всяка цена','Минимални данни','Всякакви данни','Валидност','Всякакъв срок','Мрежа','Всяка мрежа','Само неограничени','Показвай планове с неограничени данни.','Само 5G','Показвай планове с 5G.','Нулиране','Приложи филтри','Сканирай код','Сканирай QR/баркод, качи изображение или постави код.','Готово за сканиране.','Търси','Стартирай камера','Качи изображение','Постави код, URL или дестинация']
  };
  const F=(k)=>{const arr=FL[currentLang]||FL.en; const i=FK.indexOf(k); return i>=0?(arr[i]||FL.en[i]||k):k;};
  function applyFinalLanguage(){
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-final-i18n]').forEach(el=>{el.textContent=F(el.dataset.finalI18n);});
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-final-placeholder]').forEach(el=>{el.placeholder=F(el.dataset.finalPlaceholder);});
    renderActiveFilters();
  }
  const baseSetLanguage=setLanguage;
  setLanguage=function(code){baseSetLanguage(code);applyFinalLanguage();render();};

  function freshNode(id){const old=document.getElementById(id);if(!old)return null;const n=old.cloneNode(true);old.replaceWith(n);return n;}
  document.querySelectorAll('.story,.cat').forEach(old=>{const n=old.cloneNode(true);old.replaceWith(n);});
  ['filterFab','filterApply','filterReset','filterClose','filterBackdrop','scannerStart','scannerClose','scannerFile','scannerBackdrop','sortSelect','viewAllBottom'].forEach(freshNode);

  window.showAllPlans=false;
  const adv={providers:new Set(),region:'all',price:'all',data:'all',days:'all',network:'all',unlimited:false,fiveG:false};
  const dataScore2=v=>{const s=(v||'').toLowerCase();if(s.includes('unlimited'))return 999;const m=s.match(/(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)/);return m?parseFloat(m[1]):0;};
  const daysScore2=v=>{const m=String(v||'').match(/(\d+)/);return m?parseFloat(m[1]):0;};
  const popCountry={Japan:100,Greece:98,Thailand:96,'United States':94,'United Arab Emirates':93,Spain:92,Italy:91,Turkey:90,France:89,'United Kingdom':88,Indonesia:87,Portugal:86,Germany:85,Canada:84,Switzerland:83,Netherlands:82,Romania:81,Austria:80};
  const popProvider={holafly:5,airalo:4,saily:3,nomad:2,maya:1};
  const planPopularity=(p,i)=>(popCountry[p.name]||60-i*.1)+(popProvider[p.providerKey]||0)+(p.data==='Unlimited'?1.5:0)+(String(p.network).includes('5G')?1:0);
  function regionOK2(p){ if(adv.region==='all') return true; return (regionMap[adv.region]||[]).includes(p.name); }
  function advancedOK(p){
    if(adv.providers.size && !adv.providers.has(p.providerKey))return false;
    if(!regionOK2(p))return false;
    if(adv.price!=='all' && pnum(p)>+adv.price)return false;
    if(adv.data!=='all' && (adv.data==='999'?dataScore2(p.data)<999:dataScore2(p.data)<+adv.data))return false;
    if(adv.days!=='all' && daysScore2(p.days)<+adv.days)return false;
    if(adv.network!=='all' && !String(p.network).includes(adv.network))return false;
    if(adv.unlimited && dataScore2(p.data)<999)return false;
    if(adv.fiveG && !String(p.network).includes('5G'))return false;
    return true;
  }
  window.render=function(){
    let arr=plans.map((p,i)=>({p,i})).filter(({p})=>(!query||p.name.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()))&&catOK(p)&&advancedOK(p));
    if(window.sortMode==='priceAsc')arr.sort((a,b)=>pnum(a.p)-pnum(b.p));
    else if(window.sortMode==='priceDesc')arr.sort((a,b)=>pnum(b.p)-pnum(a.p));
    else if(window.sortMode==='dataDesc')arr.sort((a,b)=>dataScore2(b.p.data)-dataScore2(a.p.data));
    else if(window.sortMode==='validityDesc')arr.sort((a,b)=>daysScore2(b.p.days)-daysScore2(a.p.days));
    else arr.sort((a,b)=>planPopularity(b.p,b.i)-planPopularity(a.p,a.i));
    const totalMatches=arr.length;
    const visibleArr=window.showAllPlans?arr:arr.slice(0,8);
    grid.innerHTML='';
    visibleArr.forEach(({p},i)=>{
      const el=document.createElement('article');el.className='card';
      el.innerHTML=`<img src="${p.img}" alt="${p.name}">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-badge">${badge(i)}</span><button class="card-save" type="button" aria-label="Save">♡</button></div>
        <div class="card-bottom">
          <div class="card-title-row"><div class="card-title-wrap"><h3><span class="card-flag">${p.flag}</span>${p.name} eSIM</h3><div class="card-provider">${p.provider}</div></div><div class="card-price-stack"><div class="card-price">${p.price}</div><button class="card-view" type="button">${viewLabel()}</button></div></div>
          <div class="card-meta"><span>${localizeDataLabel(p.data)}</span><span>${localizeValidity(p.days)}</span>${p.network?`<span>${p.network}</span>`:''}</div>
        </div>`;
      el.onclick=()=>openPlan(p);
      el.querySelector('.card-view')?.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.stopPropagation();openPlan(p)});
      el.querySelector('.card-save')?.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.stopPropagation();const b=e.currentTarget;b.classList.toggle('saved');b.textContent=b.classList.contains('saved')?'♥':'♡';});
      grid.appendChild(el);
    });
    empty.style.display=arr.length?'none':'block';
    gridTitle.textContent=query?`${t('resultsFor')} "${query}"`:t('popularEsims');
    gridSub.textContent=`${totalMatches} ${t('plansShown')}`;
    const vb=document.getElementById('viewAllBottom');if(vb)vb.style.display=(totalMatches>8&&!window.showAllPlans)?'inline-flex':'none';
    renderActiveFilters();
  };

  function syncFilterForm(){
    document.querySelectorAll('#filterProviders input').forEach(x=>x.checked=adv.providers.has(x.value));
    const m={filterRegion:adv.region,filterPrice:adv.price,filterData:adv.data,filterDays:adv.days,filterNetwork:adv.network};
    Object.entries(m).forEach(([id,val])=>{const el=document.getElementById(id);if(el)el.value=val;});
    const u=document.getElementById('filterUnlimited');if(u)u.checked=adv.unlimited;
    const g=document.getElementById('filter5G');if(g)g.checked=adv.fiveG;
  }
  function syncTopControls(){
    document.querySelectorAll('.story').forEach(s=>s.classList.toggle('active',adv.providers.size===0?s.dataset.provider==='all':(adv.providers.size===1&&adv.providers.has(s.dataset.provider))));
    let preset='all';
    if(adv.region!=='all')preset=adv.region;
    else if(adv.unlimited)preset='unlimited';
    else if(adv.fiveG)preset='5g';
    else if(adv.price==='10')preset='under10';
    else if(adv.data==='10')preset='10gb';
    else if(adv.days==='30')preset='30days';
    document.querySelectorAll('.cat').forEach(c=>c.classList.toggle('active',c.dataset.cat===preset));
  }
  function clearPresetFilters(){adv.region='all';adv.price='all';adv.data='all';adv.days='all';adv.unlimited=false;adv.fiveG=false;}
  function renderActiveFilters(){
    const row=document.getElementById('activeFilters');if(!row)return;
    const items=[];
    adv.providers.forEach(v=>items.push({k:'provider:'+v,label:v.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+v.slice(1)}));
    if(adv.region!=='all')items.push({k:'region',label:adv.region.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+adv.region.slice(1)});
    if(adv.price!=='all')items.push({k:'price',label:`≤ €${adv.price}`});
    if(adv.data!=='all')items.push({k:'data',label:adv.data==='999'?t('unlimited'):`${adv.data}+ GB`});
    if(adv.days!=='all')items.push({k:'days',label:`${adv.days}+ days`});
    if(adv.unlimited)items.push({k:'unlimited',label:F('unlimitedOnly')});
    if(adv.fiveG)items.push({k:'fiveg',label:F('fiveGOnly')});
    if(window.sortMode&&window.sortMode!=='popular')items.push({k:'sort',label:document.querySelector('#sortSelect option:checked')?.textContent||''});
    row.classList.toggle('has-items',items.length>0);
    row.innerHTML=items.map(x=>`<span class="active-filter-chip">${x.label}<button type="button" data-remove-filter="${x.k}">×</button></span>`).join('');
    row.querySelectorAll('[data-remove-filter]').forEach(b=>{b.onclick=()=>{const k=b.dataset.removeFilter;if(k.startsWith('provider:'))adv.providers.delete(k.split(':')[1]);else if(k==='region')adv.region='all';else if(k==='price')adv.price='all';else if(k==='data')adv.data='all';else if(k==='days')adv.days='all';else if(k==='unlimited')adv.unlimited=false;else if(k==='fiveg')adv.fiveG=false;else if(k==='sort'){window.sortMode='popular';document.getElementById('sortSelect').value='popular';}syncFilterForm();syncTopControls();render();};});
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.story').forEach(s=>s.addEventListener('click',()=>{window.showAllPlans=false;adv.providers.clear();if(s.dataset.provider!=='all')adv.providers.add(s.dataset.provider);providerFilter='all';syncFilterForm();syncTopControls();render();}));
  document.querySelectorAll('.cat').forEach(c=>c.addEventListener('click',()=>{window.showAllPlans=false;clearPresetFilters();catFilter='all';const v=c.dataset.cat;if(v==='under10')adv.price='10';else if(v==='10gb')adv.data='10';else if(v==='30days')adv.days='30';else if(v==='unlimited')adv.unlimited=true;else if(v==='5g')adv.fiveG=true;else if(['europe','asia','americas'].includes(v))adv.region=v;syncFilterForm();syncTopControls();render();}));

  const filterSheetNow=document.getElementById('filterSheet'), filterBackdropNow=document.getElementById('filterBackdrop');
  function openFiltersNow(){filterBackdropNow?.classList.add('open');filterSheetNow?.classList.add('open');document.body.style.overflow='hidden';syncFilterForm();}
  function closeFiltersNow(){filterBackdropNow?.classList.remove('open');filterSheetNow?.classList.remove('open');document.body.style.overflow='';}
  document.getElementById('filterFab')?.addEventListener('click',openFiltersNow);
  document.getElementById('filterClose')?.addEventListener('click',closeFiltersNow);
  filterBackdropNow?.addEventListener('click',closeFiltersNow);

  function readFilterForm(){
    adv.providers=new Set([...document.querySelectorAll('#filterProviders input:checked')].map(x=>x.value));
    adv.region=document.getElementById('filterRegion')?.value||'all';adv.price=document.getElementById('filterPrice')?.value||'all';adv.data=document.getElementById('filterData')?.value||'all';adv.days=document.getElementById('filterDays')?.value||'all';adv.network=document.getElementById('filterNetwork')?.value||'all';adv.unlimited=!!document.getElementById('filterUnlimited')?.checked;adv.fiveG=!!document.getElementById('filter5G')?.checked;providerFilter='all';catFilter='all';
  }
  const filterApply=document.getElementById('filterApply');filterApply?.addEventListener('click',()=>{window.showAllPlans=false;readFilterForm();syncTopControls();render();closeFiltersNow();});
  document.getElementById('filterReset')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{adv.providers.clear();adv.region=adv.price=adv.data=adv.days=adv.network='all';adv.unlimited=adv.fiveG=false;window.sortMode='popular';document.getElementById('sortSelect').value='popular';syncFilterForm();syncTopControls();render();});
  document.getElementById('sortSelect')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{window.sortMode=e.target.value;render();});
  document.getElementById('viewAllBottom')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{window.showAllPlans=true;render();});

  // Robust scanner with BarcodeDetector + jsQR fallback + manual input
  const scannerBackdrop=document.getElementById('scannerBackdrop'), scannerSheet=document.getElementById('scannerSheet'), scannerVideo=document.getElementById('scannerVideo'), scannerCanvas=document.getElementById('scannerCanvas'), scannerStatus=document.getElementById('scannerStatus');
  let scanStream=null,scanLoop=null,detector=null;
  function setScanStatus(txt){if(scannerStatus)scannerStatus.textContent=txt;}
  function openScan(){scannerBackdrop?.classList.add('open');scannerSheet?.classList.add('open');document.body.style.overflow='hidden';setScanStatus(F('scannerIdle'));}
  function closeScan(){scannerBackdrop?.classList.remove('open');scannerSheet?.classList.remove('open');document.body.style.overflow='';if(scanLoop){clearInterval(scanLoop);scanLoop=null;}if(scanStream){scanStream.getTracks().forEach(t=>t.stop());scanStream=null;}if(scannerVideo)scannerVideo.srcObject=null;}
  function normalizedScanText(raw){try{return decodeURIComponent(String(raw||'').trim())}catch(e){return String(raw||'').trim()}}
  function searchScanned(raw){const text=normalizedScanText(raw);if(!text)return;const lower=text.toLowerCase();let match=plans.find(p=>lower.includes(p.name.toLowerCase())||p.name.toLowerCase().includes(lower));if(!match){try{const u=new URL(text);const q=u.searchParams.get('destination')||u.searchParams.get('country')||u.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop();if(q)match=plans.find(p=>q.toLowerCase().includes(p.name.toLowerCase())||p.name.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase()));}catch(e){}}
    const term=match?match.name:text;window.showAllPlans=false;searchInput.value=term;query=term;adv.providers.clear();adv.region=adv.price=adv.data=adv.days=adv.network='all';adv.unlimited=adv.fiveG=false;catFilter='all';providerFilter='all';render();closeScan();setTimeout(()=>grid.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'}),50);
  }
  async function detectFromSource(source){
    if('BarcodeDetector' in window){try{detector=detector||new BarcodeDetector({formats:['qr_code','ean_13','code_128','upc_a','upc_e']});const codes=await detector.detect(source);if(codes?.length)return codes[0].rawValue||'';}catch(e){}}
    if(window.jsQR){try{const c=scannerCanvas,ctx=c.getContext('2d');const w=source.videoWidth||source.width,h=source.videoHeight||source.height;if(!w||!h)return'';c.width=w;c.height=h;ctx.drawImage(source,0,0,w,h);const img=ctx.getImageData(0,0,w,h);const code=window.jsQR(img.data,w,h,{inversionAttempts:'dontInvert'});return code?.data||'';}catch(e){}}
    return'';
  }
  async function startCamera(){openScan();if(!navigator.mediaDevices?.getUserMedia){setScanStatus(F('uploadImage')+' / '+F('pasteCode'));return;}try{scanStream=await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({video:{facingMode:{ideal:'environment'},width:{ideal:1280},height:{ideal:720}},audio:false});scannerVideo.srcObject=scanStream;await scannerVideo.play();setScanStatus(F('scannerIdle'));scanLoop=setInterval(async()=>{const v=await detectFromSource(scannerVideo);if(v)searchScanned(v);},450);}catch(e){setScanStatus(F('uploadImage')+' / '+F('pasteCode'));}}
  async function scanFile(file){if(!file)return;openScan();setScanStatus(F('scannerIdle'));try{const bmp=await createImageBitmap(file);const v=await detectFromSource(bmp);if(v)searchScanned(v);else setScanStatus(F('pasteCode'));}catch(e){setScanStatus(F('uploadImage')+' / '+F('pasteCode'));}}
  const scanBtn=document.getElementById('searchBtn');if(scanBtn)scanBtn.onclick=e=>{e.preventDefault();openScan();};
  document.getElementById('searchInput')?.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();window.showAllPlans=false;query=e.currentTarget.value.trim();adv.providers.clear();adv.region=adv.price=adv.data=adv.days=adv.network='all';adv.unlimited=adv.fiveG=false;providerFilter='all';catFilter='all';syncFilterForm();syncTopControls();render();grid.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}},true);
  document.getElementById('scannerClose')?.addEventListener('click',closeScan);scannerBackdrop?.addEventListener('click',closeScan);document.getElementById('scannerStart')?.addEventListener('click',startCamera);document.getElementById('scannerFile')?.addEventListener('change',e=>scanFile(e.target.files?.[0]));document.getElementById('scannerManualGo')?.addEventListener('click',()=>searchScanned(document.getElementById('scannerManual')?.value));document.getElementById('scannerManual')?.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')searchScanned(e.currentTarget.value)});

  // Inline travel tools: preserve functionality and synchronize currency
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-inline-tool]').forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-inline-tool]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===btn));document.querySelectorAll('.inline-tool-panel').forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.id==='inline-tool-'+btn.dataset.inlineTool));}));
  document.getElementById('inlineCostCurrency')?.addEventListener('change',()=>document.getElementById('inlineCostBtn')?.click());

  syncFilterForm();syncTopControls();applyFinalLanguage();render();
})();

</script>
<script>
(function(){
  const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), $$=s=>[...document.querySelectorAll(s)];
  const N=id=>{const x=parseFloat(document.getElementById(id)?.value);return Number.isFinite(x)?x:0};
  const sym={EUR:'€',USD:'$',GBP:'£'};
  const dataScore=v=>{const s=String(v||'').toLowerCase();if(s.includes('unlimited'))return 999;const m=s.match(/(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)/);return m?parseFloat(m[1]):0};

  // Localized generic advice, deliberately non-assertive so it is useful for every destination.
  const ADV={
    en:['Check local 4G/5G coverage in {d} and activate the eSIM before you need data.','Check your home operator roaming settings before departure and keep the primary SIM roaming off if you do not need it.','Save offline maps for {d} and check the main local transit or ride-hailing options before arrival.','Keep a backup payment method and check whether cash is useful for smaller purchases in {d}.','Check the plug type and voltage used in {d} before packing an adapter.'],
    ro:['Verifică acoperirea locală 4G/5G în {d} și activează eSIM-ul înainte să ai nevoie de date.','Verifică setările de roaming ale operatorului tău înainte de plecare și ține roamingul SIM-ului principal oprit dacă nu ai nevoie de el.','Salvează hărți offline pentru {d} și verifică opțiunile locale de transport sau ride-hailing înainte să ajungi.','Păstrează o metodă de plată de rezervă și verifică dacă numerarul este util pentru cumpărături mici în {d}.','Verifică tipul prizelor și tensiunea folosite în {d} înainte să iei un adaptor.'],
    de:['Prüfe die lokale 4G/5G-Abdeckung in {d} und aktiviere die eSIM, bevor du Daten brauchst.','Prüfe vor der Abreise die Roaming-Einstellungen deines Heimatanbieters und lass Roaming auf der Haupt-SIM aus, wenn du es nicht brauchst.','Speichere Offline-Karten für {d} und prüfe lokale ÖPNV- oder Fahrdienst-Optionen vor der Ankunft.','Halte eine zweite Zahlungsmethode bereit und prüfe, ob Bargeld für kleine Einkäufe in {d} sinnvoll ist.','Prüfe Steckertyp und Spannung in {d}, bevor du einen Adapter einpackst.'],
    fr:['Vérifiez la couverture 4G/5G locale à {d} et activez l’eSIM avant d’avoir besoin de données.','Vérifiez les réglages d’itinérance de votre opérateur avant le départ et désactivez l’itinérance de la SIM principale si elle n’est pas nécessaire.','Enregistrez des cartes hors ligne pour {d} et vérifiez les transports locaux ou services de VTC avant l’arrivée.','Gardez un moyen de paiement de secours et vérifiez si des espèces sont utiles pour les petits achats à {d}.','Vérifiez le type de prise et la tension utilisés à {d} avant d’emporter un adaptateur.'],
    es:['Comprueba la cobertura 4G/5G local en {d} y activa la eSIM antes de necesitar datos.','Revisa el roaming de tu operador antes de salir y deja desactivado el roaming de la SIM principal si no lo necesitas.','Guarda mapas sin conexión de {d} y revisa el transporte local o las apps de movilidad antes de llegar.','Lleva un método de pago de respaldo y comprueba si conviene llevar efectivo para compras pequeñas en {d}.','Comprueba el tipo de enchufe y el voltaje usados en {d} antes de llevar un adaptador.'],
    it:['Controlla la copertura 4G/5G locale a {d} e attiva l’eSIM prima di aver bisogno dei dati.','Controlla le impostazioni roaming del tuo operatore prima della partenza e lascia disattivato il roaming della SIM principale se non serve.','Salva mappe offline per {d} e verifica trasporto locale o app di mobilità prima dell’arrivo.','Tieni un metodo di pagamento di riserva e verifica se il contante è utile per piccoli acquisti a {d}.','Controlla tipo di presa e tensione usati a {d} prima di portare un adattatore.'],
    pt:['Verifique a cobertura 4G/5G local em {d} e ative o eSIM antes de precisar de dados.','Verifique as definições de roaming do seu operador antes da partida e mantenha o roaming do SIM principal desligado se não precisar.','Guarde mapas offline de {d} e verifique transportes locais ou apps de mobilidade antes de chegar.','Tenha um método de pagamento alternativo e confirme se dinheiro é útil para pequenas compras em {d}.','Confirme o tipo de tomada e a tensão usados em {d} antes de levar um adaptador.'],
    nl:['Controleer lokale 4G/5G-dekking in {d} en activeer de eSIM voordat je data nodig hebt.','Controleer roaminginstellingen van je thuisprovider voor vertrek en laat roaming op de hoofd-SIM uit als je die niet nodig hebt.','Sla offline kaarten van {d} op en bekijk lokaal vervoer of rit-apps voor aankomst.','Houd een reservebetaalmethode bij de hand en controleer of contant geld handig is voor kleine aankopen in {d}.','Controleer stekkertype en voltage in {d} voordat je een adapter inpakt.'],
    pl:['Sprawdź lokalny zasięg 4G/5G w {d} i aktywuj eSIM zanim będziesz potrzebować internetu.','Przed wyjazdem sprawdź ustawienia roamingu operatora i wyłącz roaming głównej karty SIM, jeśli go nie potrzebujesz.','Zapisz mapy offline dla {d} i sprawdź lokalny transport lub aplikacje przejazdowe przed przyjazdem.','Miej zapasową metodę płatności i sprawdź, czy gotówka przydaje się przy drobnych zakupach w {d}.','Sprawdź typ gniazdek i napięcie w {d} przed spakowaniem adaptera.'],
    ja:['{d} の現地4G/5Gカバレッジを確認し、データが必要になる前にeSIMを有効化してください。','出発前に契約中の通信会社のローミング設定を確認し、不要ならメインSIMのローミングをオフにしてください。','{d} のオフライン地図を保存し、到着前に現地交通や配車サービスを確認してください。','予備の支払い方法を用意し、{d} の少額決済で現金が役立つか確認してください。','{d} のプラグ形状と電圧を確認してから変換アダプターを準備してください。'],
    zh:['查看 {d} 当地的 4G/5G 覆盖，并在需要流量前启用 eSIM。','出发前检查原运营商的漫游设置，如不需要请关闭主 SIM 的漫游。','保存 {d} 的离线地图，并在抵达前查看当地公共交通或打车方式。','准备备用支付方式，并确认在 {d} 小额消费时是否需要现金。','携带转换插头前，请确认 {d} 使用的插头类型和电压。'],
    tr:['{d} içindeki yerel 4G/5G kapsamasını kontrol edin ve veriye ihtiyaç duymadan önce eSIM’i etkinleştirin.','Yola çıkmadan önce ana operatörünüzün dolaşım ayarlarını kontrol edin ve gerekmiyorsa ana SIM dolaşımını kapalı tutun.','{d} için çevrimdışı haritaları kaydedin ve varmadan önce yerel ulaşım veya araç çağırma seçeneklerini kontrol edin.','Yedek bir ödeme yöntemi bulundurun ve {d} içindeki küçük alışverişlerde nakdin yararlı olup olmadığını kontrol edin.','Adaptör almadan önce {d} içindeki priz tipini ve voltajı kontrol edin.'],
    ko:['{d}의 현지 4G/5G 커버리지를 확인하고 데이터가 필요하기 전에 eSIM을 활성화하세요.','출발 전에 기존 통신사의 로밍 설정을 확인하고 필요하지 않다면 기본 SIM의 로밍을 꺼두세요.','{d}의 오프라인 지도를 저장하고 도착 전에 현지 대중교통이나 호출 서비스를 확인하세요.','예비 결제 수단을 준비하고 {d}에서 소액 결제 시 현금이 필요한지 확인하세요.','어댑터를 준비하기 전에 {d}에서 사용하는 플러그 유형과 전압을 확인하세요.'],
    ar:['تحقق من تغطية 4G/5G المحلية في {d} وفعّل eSIM قبل الحاجة إلى البيانات.','تحقق من إعدادات التجوال لدى مشغلك قبل السفر وأوقف تجوال الشريحة الأساسية إذا لم تكن بحاجة إليه.','احفظ خرائط {d} للاستخدام دون اتصال وتحقق من النقل المحلي أو تطبيقات التنقل قبل الوصول.','احتفظ بطريقة دفع احتياطية وتحقق مما إذا كان النقد مفيداً للمشتريات الصغيرة في {d}.','تحقق من نوع القابس والجهد المستخدمين في {d} قبل أخذ محول كهربائي.'],
    th:['ตรวจสอบสัญญาณ 4G/5G ใน {d} และเปิดใช้ eSIM ก่อนที่จะต้องใช้อินเทอร์เน็ต','ตรวจสอบการตั้งค่าโรมมิ่งของผู้ให้บริการเดิมก่อนเดินทาง และปิดโรมมิ่งของซิมหลักหากไม่จำเป็น','บันทึกแผนที่ออฟไลน์ของ {d} และตรวจสอบระบบขนส่งหรือแอปเรียกรถก่อนเดินทางถึง','เตรียมวิธีชำระเงินสำรองและตรวจสอบว่าเงินสดมีประโยชน์สำหรับการซื้อเล็ก ๆ ใน {d} หรือไม่','ตรวจสอบประเภทปลั๊กและแรงดันไฟใน {d} ก่อนเตรียมอะแดปเตอร์'],
    cs:['Zkontrolujte místní pokrytí 4G/5G v {d} a aktivujte eSIM dříve, než budete potřebovat data.','Před odjezdem zkontrolujte roaming u svého operátora a vypněte roaming hlavní SIM, pokud jej nepotřebujete.','Uložte si offline mapy pro {d} a před příjezdem zkontrolujte místní dopravu nebo aplikace pro přepravu.','Mějte záložní platební metodu a ověřte, zda se v {d} hodí hotovost pro menší nákupy.','Před zabalením adaptéru zkontrolujte typ zásuvky a napětí používané v {d}.'],
    hu:['Ellenőrizd a helyi 4G/5G lefedettséget {d} területén, és aktiváld az eSIM-et, mielőtt adatforgalomra lenne szükséged.','Indulás előtt ellenőrizd az otthoni szolgáltatód roamingbeállításait, és kapcsold ki a fő SIM roamingját, ha nincs rá szükséged.','Ments offline térképet {d} területéről, és érkezés előtt nézd meg a helyi közlekedési lehetőségeket.','Tarts tartalék fizetési módot, és ellenőrizd, hogy {d} területén hasznos-e készpénz kisebb vásárlásokhoz.','Adapter csomagolása előtt ellenőrizd a {d} területén használt csatlakozótípust és feszültséget.'],
    sv:['Kontrollera lokal 4G/5G-täckning i {d} och aktivera eSIM innan du behöver data.','Kontrollera din hemoperatörs roaminginställningar före avresa och stäng av roaming på huvud-SIM om den inte behövs.','Spara offlinekartor för {d} och kontrollera lokal kollektivtrafik eller resetjänster före ankomst.','Ha en extra betalningsmetod och kontrollera om kontanter är praktiska för småköp i {d}.','Kontrollera kontakttyp och spänning i {d} innan du packar en adapter.'],
    da:['Tjek lokal 4G/5G-dækning i {d} og aktiver eSIM, før du får brug for data.','Tjek din hjemmeudbyders roamingindstillinger før afrejse, og slå roaming fra på hoved-SIM, hvis det ikke er nødvendigt.','Gem offlinekort over {d} og tjek lokal transport eller kørselstjenester før ankomst.','Hav en ekstra betalingsmetode og tjek, om kontanter er nyttige til små køb i {d}.','Tjek stiktype og spænding i {d}, før du pakker en adapter.'],
    fi:['Tarkista paikallinen 4G/5G-peitto kohteessa {d} ja aktivoi eSIM ennen kuin tarvitset dataa.','Tarkista kotiverkkosi roaming-asetukset ennen lähtöä ja pidä pää-SIMin roaming pois päältä, jos et tarvitse sitä.','Tallenna {d} offline-kartat ja tarkista paikallinen liikenne tai kyytipalvelut ennen saapumista.','Pidä varamaksutapa mukana ja tarkista, onko käteinen hyödyllinen pieniin ostoksiin kohteessa {d}.','Tarkista {d} pistoketyyppi ja jännite ennen adapterin pakkaamista.'],
    no:['Sjekk lokal 4G/5G-dekning i {d} og aktiver eSIM før du trenger data.','Sjekk roaminginnstillingene hos hjemmeoperatøren før avreise og slå av roaming på hoved-SIM hvis du ikke trenger det.','Lagre offlinekart for {d} og sjekk lokal transport eller bestillingstjenester før ankomst.','Ha en ekstra betalingsmetode og sjekk om kontanter er nyttige for små kjøp i {d}.','Sjekk kontakttype og spenning i {d} før du pakker adapter.'],
    uk:['Перевірте місцеве покриття 4G/5G у {d} та активуйте eSIM до того, як знадобляться дані.','Перед виїздом перевірте налаштування роумінгу домашнього оператора та вимкніть роумінг основної SIM, якщо він не потрібен.','Збережіть офлайн-карти для {d} та перевірте місцевий транспорт або сервіси поїздок до прибуття.','Майте резервний спосіб оплати та перевірте, чи корисна готівка для дрібних покупок у {d}.','Перевірте тип розетки та напругу в {d} перед тим, як брати адаптер.'],
    ru:['Проверьте местное покрытие 4G/5G в {d} и активируйте eSIM до того, как понадобится интернет.','Перед поездкой проверьте настройки роуминга домашнего оператора и отключите роуминг основной SIM, если он не нужен.','Сохраните офлайн-карты для {d} и проверьте местный транспорт или сервисы поездок до прибытия.','Имейте запасной способ оплаты и проверьте, пригодятся ли наличные для небольших покупок в {d}.','Проверьте тип розеток и напряжение в {d}, прежде чем брать адаптер.'],
    hi:['{d} में स्थानीय 4G/5G कवरेज जांचें और डेटा की जरूरत से पहले eSIM सक्रिय करें।','रवाना होने से पहले अपने घरेलू ऑपरेटर की रोमिंग सेटिंग जांचें और जरूरत न हो तो मुख्य SIM की रोमिंग बंद रखें।','{d} के ऑफलाइन मैप सेव करें और पहुंचने से पहले स्थानीय परिवहन या राइड सेवाओं की जांच करें।','एक बैकअप भुगतान तरीका रखें और देखें कि {d} में छोटी खरीदारी के लिए नकद उपयोगी है या नहीं।','एडेप्टर पैक करने से पहले {d} में उपयोग होने वाले प्लग प्रकार और वोल्टेज की जांच करें।'],
    id:['Periksa cakupan 4G/5G lokal di {d} dan aktifkan eSIM sebelum membutuhkan data.','Periksa pengaturan roaming operator asal sebelum berangkat dan matikan roaming SIM utama jika tidak diperlukan.','Simpan peta offline untuk {d} dan periksa transportasi lokal atau layanan ride-hailing sebelum tiba.','Siapkan metode pembayaran cadangan dan periksa apakah uang tunai berguna untuk pembelian kecil di {d}.','Periksa jenis colokan dan tegangan di {d} sebelum membawa adaptor.'],
    ms:['Semak liputan 4G/5G tempatan di {d} dan aktifkan eSIM sebelum anda memerlukan data.','Semak tetapan perayauan operator asal sebelum berlepas dan matikan perayauan SIM utama jika tidak diperlukan.','Simpan peta luar talian untuk {d} dan semak pengangkutan tempatan atau aplikasi e-hailing sebelum tiba.','Sediakan kaedah pembayaran sandaran dan semak sama ada wang tunai berguna untuk pembelian kecil di {d}.','Semak jenis palam dan voltan di {d} sebelum membawa penyesuai.'],
    vi:['Kiểm tra vùng phủ 4G/5G tại {d} và kích hoạt eSIM trước khi cần dùng dữ liệu.','Kiểm tra cài đặt roaming của nhà mạng gốc trước khi đi và tắt roaming SIM chính nếu không cần.','Lưu bản đồ ngoại tuyến của {d} và xem phương tiện công cộng hoặc ứng dụng gọi xe trước khi đến.','Chuẩn bị phương thức thanh toán dự phòng và kiểm tra xem tiền mặt có hữu ích cho các khoản mua nhỏ ở {d} không.','Kiểm tra loại ổ cắm và điện áp dùng tại {d} trước khi mang bộ chuyển đổi.'],
    he:['בדוק כיסוי 4G/5G מקומי ב-{d} והפעל את ה-eSIM לפני שתזדקק לנתונים.','בדוק את הגדרות הנדידה אצל המפעיל הביתי לפני היציאה וכבה נדידה ב-SIM הראשי אם אין צורך בה.','שמור מפות לא מקוונות של {d} ובדוק תחבורה מקומית או שירותי נסיעות לפני ההגעה.','החזק אמצעי תשלום חלופי ובדוק אם מזומן שימושי לרכישות קטנות ב-{d}.','בדוק את סוג השקע והמתח ב-{d} לפני אריזת מתאם.'],
    hr:['Provjeri lokalnu 4G/5G pokrivenost u {d} i aktiviraj eSIM prije nego što ti zatrebaju podaci.','Prije polaska provjeri roaming postavke svog matičnog operatera i isključi roaming glavne SIM kartice ako nije potreban.','Spremi offline karte za {d} i prije dolaska provjeri lokalni prijevoz ili aplikacije za vožnju.','Imaj rezervni način plaćanja i provjeri je li gotovina korisna za manje kupnje u {d}.','Provjeri tip utičnice i napon u {d} prije pakiranja adaptera.'],
    bg:['Проверете местното 4G/5G покритие в {d} и активирайте eSIM преди да ви потрябват данни.','Преди отпътуване проверете настройките за роуминг на домашния оператор и изключете роуминга на основната SIM, ако не ви трябва.','Запазете офлайн карти за {d} и проверете местния транспорт или услугите за превоз преди пристигане.','Имайте резервен начин за плащане и проверете дали кешът е полезен за малки покупки в {d}.','Проверете типа контакт и напрежението в {d} преди да вземете адаптер.']
  };
  function langPack(){return ADV[currentLang]||ADV.en}
  function esc(s){return String(s||'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]))}

  function switchTool(name){$$('[data-inline-tool]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.inlineTool===name));$$('.inline-tool-panel').forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.id==='inline-tool-'+name));}
  $$('[data-inline-tool]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>switchTool(b.dataset.inlineTool)));

  function costResult(){const days=Math.max(1,N('inlineCostDays')),stay=N('inlineCostStay'),food=N('inlineCostFood'),transport=N('inlineCostTransport'),esim=N('inlineCostEsim');const cur=$('#inlineCostCurrency')?.value||'EUR';const total=days*(stay+food+transport)+esim;const d=$('#inlineCostDestination')?.value||'';const box=$('#inlineCostResult');if(!box)return;box.classList.add('active');box.innerHTML=`<h4>${t('estimatedBudget')}${d?' - '+esc(d):''}</h4><div class="big-result">${sym[cur]||cur}${Math.round(total).toLocaleString()}</div><div class="mini-grid"><div><small>${t('accommodationLabel')}</small><strong>${sym[cur]||cur}${Math.round(days*stay).toLocaleString()}</strong></div><div><small>${t('foodLabel')}</small><strong>${sym[cur]||cur}${Math.round(days*food).toLocaleString()}</strong></div><div><small>${t('transportLabel')}</small><strong>${sym[cur]||cur}${Math.round(days*transport).toLocaleString()}</strong></div><div><small>${t('esimLabel')}</small><strong>${sym[cur]||cur}${Math.round(esim).toLocaleString()}</strong></div></div>`;}
  $('#inlineCostBtn')?.addEventListener('click',costResult);$('#inlineCostCurrency')?.addEventListener('change',()=>{$('#inlineCostResult')?.classList.contains('active')&&costResult()});

  function recommend(){const dest=($('#inlineAdvisorDestination')?.value||'').trim();const days=Math.max(1,N('inlineAdvisorDays'));const usage=$('#inlineAdvisorUsage')?.value||'medium';const hotspot=!!$('#inlineAdvisorHotspot')?.checked;const want5g=!!$('#inlineAdvisor5g')?.checked;let gb=usage==='light'?Math.ceil(days*.55):usage==='heavy'?Math.ceil(days*2.1):Math.ceil(days*1.15);if(hotspot)gb+=5;gb=Math.max(gb,3);let cand=plans.filter(p=>!dest||p.name.toLowerCase()===dest.toLowerCase());if(!cand.length)cand=plans.slice();cand=cand.filter(p=>dataScore(p.data)>=gb && (!want5g||String(p.network).includes('5G'))).sort((a,b)=>parseFloat(a.price.replace('€',''))-parseFloat(b.price.replace('€','')));const best=cand[0];const box=$('#inlineAdvisorResult');if(!box)return;box.classList.add('active');box.innerHTML=`<h4>${t('recommendationTitle')}</h4><div class="big-result">${gb} GB</div><div class="mini-grid"><div><small>${t('destinationLabel')}</small><strong>${esc(best?.name||dest||'—')}</strong></div><div><small>${t('detailNetwork')||'Network'}</small><strong>${esc(best?.network||(want5g?'5G':'4G/5G'))}</strong></div><div><small>${t('detailPrice')||'Price'}</small><strong>${esc(best?.price||'—')}</strong></div><div><small>${t('esimLabel')}</small><strong>${esc(best?.provider||'—')}</strong></div></div>`;}
  $('#inlineAdvisorBtn')?.addEventListener('click',recommend);

  function advice(){const d=($('#inlineAdviceDestination')?.value||'Japan').trim();const vals=langPack().map(x=>x.replaceAll('{d}',esc(d)));const labels=[t('internetTip'),t('roamingTip'),t('transportTip'),t('moneyTip'),t('powerTip')];const wrap=$('#inlineAdviceList');if(!wrap)return;wrap.innerHTML=vals.map((v,i)=>`<article class="inline-advice-item"><h5>${labels[i]}</h5><p>${v}</p></article>`).join('');$$('#inlineAdviceList .inline-advice-item').forEach(c=>c.addEventListener('click',()=>c.classList.toggle('expanded')));}
  $('#inlineAdviceBtn')?.addEventListener('click',advice);

  let socialTheme='tokyo',socialFormat='post';
  function socialPreview(){const d=$('#inlineCardDestination')?.value||'Japan',days=$('#inlineCardDays')?.value||'7',budget=N('inlineCardBudget'),data=$('#inlineCardData')?.value||'10 GB';$('#tripCardTitle').textContent=d;$('#tripDaysBadge').textContent=days;$('#tripBudgetBadge').textContent='€'+Math.round(budget).toLocaleString();$('#tripDataBadge').textContent=data;const p=$('#tripCardPreview');if(p){p.classList.remove('theme-tokyo','theme-sunset','theme-night','story-format');p.classList.add('theme-'+socialTheme);if(socialFormat==='story')p.classList.add('story-format');}paintCanvas();}
  function paintCanvas(){const c=$('#inlineTripCanvas');if(!c)return null;const story=socialFormat==='story';c.width=story?1080:1080;c.height=story?1920:1080;const ctx=c.getContext('2d'),w=c.width,h=c.height;const grads={tokyo:['#ff5d78','#884dff','#2ab8ff'],sunset:['#ff8a50','#ff477e','#7c62ff'],night:['#07101f','#17335b','#5c3b7f']};const g=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,w,h);grads[socialTheme].forEach((x,i)=>g.addColorStop(i/(grads[socialTheme].length-1),x));ctx.fillStyle=g;ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.08)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(w*.8,h*.18,w*.24,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();const d=$('#inlineCardDestination')?.value||'Japan',days=$('#inlineCardDays')?.value||'7',budget=N('inlineCardBudget'),data=$('#inlineCardData')?.value||'10 GB';ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='700 34px Arial';ctx.fillText('LIVDAR TRIP DROP',70,80);ctx.font=`900 ${story?120:96}px Arial`;ctx.fillText(d,70,story?330:300);ctx.font='700 48px Arial';ctx.fillText('✈️  ✨  📍',70,story?420:390);const y=story?h-260:h-190;ctx.font='700 40px Arial';ctx.fillText(`📅 ${days}`,70,y);ctx.fillText(`💸 €${Math.round(budget).toLocaleString()}`,w*.36,y);ctx.fillText(`📶 ${data}`,w*.68,y);ctx.font='500 26px Arial';ctx.fillText('livdar.com',70,h-55);return c;}
  $$('[data-social-theme]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{socialTheme=b.dataset.socialTheme;$$('[data-social-theme]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));socialPreview()}));$$('[data-social-format]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{socialFormat=b.dataset.socialFormat;$$('[data-social-format]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));socialPreview()}));['inlineCardDestination','inlineCardDays','inlineCardBudget','inlineCardData'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id)?.addEventListener('input',socialPreview));$('#inlineCardBtn')?.addEventListener('click',socialPreview);$('#inlineCardDownload')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const c=paintCanvas();if(!c)return;const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=c.toDataURL('image/png');a.download='livdar-trip-card.png';a.click()});
  const actions=$('#inline-tool-card .inline-actions-row');if(actions&&!$('#inlineCardShare')){const b=document.createElement('button');b.id='inlineCardShare';b.className='inline-secondary-btn';b.type='button';b.textContent='↗';b.setAttribute('aria-label','Share');actions.appendChild(b);b.onclick=async()=>{const c=paintCanvas();if(!c)return;try{const blob=await new Promise(r=>c.toBlob(r,'image/png'));const file=new File([blob],'livdar-trip-card.png',{type:'image/png'});if(navigator.canShare?.({files:[file]}))await navigator.share({files:[file],title:'Livdar'});else if(navigator.share)await navigator.share({title:'Livdar'});else{const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=c.toDataURL('image/png');a.download='livdar-trip-card.png';a.click()}}catch(e){}}}

  // Keep dynamic content synchronized when a language is changed.
  const oldSet=window.setLanguage; if(typeof oldSet==='function'){window.setLanguage=function(code){oldSet(code);if($('#inlineAdviceList')?.children.length)advice();if($('#inlineCostResult')?.classList.contains('active'))costResult();if($('#inlineAdvisorResult')?.classList.contains('active'))recommend();};}
  advice();socialPreview();
})();
</script>
<style id="v16-final-polish">
/* --- Final polish override v16 --- */
#travelToolsShowcase{padding-top:8px!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-shell{
  position:relative!important;overflow:hidden!important;max-width:1060px!important;margin:0 auto!important;
  padding:24px 16px 16px!important;border-radius:30px!important;border:1px solid #dfe7f0!important;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff 0%,#f7faff 100%)!important;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(24,40,63,.04)!important;
}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-shell::before{
  content:""!important;position:absolute!important;left:0!important;right:0!important;top:0!important;height:194px!important;z-index:0!important;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(248,251,255,.99) 0%,rgba(248,251,255,.97) 24%,rgba(248,251,255,.82) 38%,rgba(248,251,255,.42) 56%,rgba(248,251,255,.10) 100%),
    url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")!important;
  background-size:cover!important;background-position:center center!important;background-repeat:no-repeat!important;
}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-shell::after{
  content:""!important;position:absolute!important;left:0!important;right:0!important;top:122px!important;height:82px!important;z-index:1!important;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(247,250,255,0),rgba(247,250,255,.92) 72%,#f7faff 100%)!important;
}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero,
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tabs,
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-panel{position:relative!important;z-index:2!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero{min-height:auto!important;padding:0!important;margin:0 0 14px!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero h2{margin:0!important;font-size:48px!important;line-height:.95!important;font-weight:950!important;letter-spacing:-.06em!important;color:#101621!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero p{margin:7px 0 0!important;font-size:16px!important;color:#7f8998!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tabs{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))!important;gap:12px!important;margin:0 0 14px!important;padding:0!important;overflow:visible!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab{
  min-height:138px!important;padding:14px 10px 12px!important;border-radius:24px!important;border:1px solid #dfe6ef!important;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.88)!important;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)!important;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(24,40,63,.05)!important;
  display:flex!important;flex-direction:column!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;gap:10px!important;
}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab.active{border-color:#79aefe!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(103,160,255,.12),0 12px 26px rgba(29,66,130,.08)!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab>span:last-child{display:block!important;font-size:15px!important;line-height:1.04!important;font-weight:900!important;letter-spacing:-.035em!important;color:#141a23!important;max-width:124px!important;text-align:center!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .tab-icon{
  width:88px!important;height:64px!important;border-radius:0!important;background:none!important;box-shadow:none!important;
  display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;filter:drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(44,68,104,.12))!important;
}
#travelToolsShowcase .tab-icon::before{display:none!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .tab-icon svg{width:100%!important;height:100%!important;overflow:visible!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-panel{margin:0!important;padding:15px!important;border-radius:22px!important;border:1px solid #e1e8f0!important;background:rgba(255,255,255,.97)!important;box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(26,40,61,.05)!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title h3{font-size:24px!important;letter-spacing:-.04em!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title p{font-size:14px!important}
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-icon{width:44px!important;height:44px!important;border-radius:14px!important}
#travelToolsShowcase #inlineCostBtn{margin-top:12px!important}

#how.steps-modern{max-width:1060px!important;margin:0 auto!important;padding:22px 8px 10px!important}
#how .steps-modern-head{display:flex!important;align-items:flex-end!important;justify-content:space-between!important;gap:12px!important;margin:0 0 12px!important}
#how .steps-modern-head h2{margin:0!important;font-size:32px!important;line-height:.96!important;letter-spacing:-.06em!important;font-weight:950!important;color:#11161e!important}
#how .steps-modern-head p{margin:7px 0 0!important;font-size:15px!important;color:#8d97a4!important}
#how .steps-modern-head a{font-size:14px!important;font-weight:850!important;color:#5c97e3!important;white-space:nowrap!important}
#how .steps-modern-grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))!important;gap:10px!important;padding:0!important;overflow:visible!important}
#how .step-modern{
  position:relative!important;overflow:hidden!important;height:180px!important;min-height:180px!important;padding:14px!important;
  border-radius:22px!important;border:1px solid #dfe6ed!important;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(23,39,60,.035)!important;
}
#how .step-modern.one{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff7fa 0%,#fffdfd 100%)!important}
#how .step-modern.two{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7fbff 0%,#ffffff 100%)!important}
#how .step-modern.three{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f6fff8 0%,#ffffff 100%)!important}
#how .step-modern-num{position:absolute!important;left:14px!important;top:14px!important;width:34px!important;height:34px!important;margin:0!important;border-radius:999px!important;display:grid!important;place-items:center!important;font-size:16px!important;font-weight:900!important;z-index:2!important}
#how .step-modern.one .step-modern-num{background:#ffd8e1!important;color:#de466f!important}
#how .step-modern.two .step-modern-num{background:#dcebff!important;color:#3972e5!important}
#how .step-modern.three .step-modern-num{background:#d8f6df!important;color:#13994b!important}
#how .step-modern-visual{position:absolute!important;right:12px!important;top:12px!important;width:68px!important;height:68px!important;opacity:1!important}
#how .step-modern-visual svg{width:100%!important;height:100%!important;display:block!important}
#how .step-modern h4{position:absolute!important;left:14px!important;right:12px!important;bottom:44px!important;margin:0!important;font-size:20px!important;line-height:1.02!important;font-weight:950!important;letter-spacing:-.04em!important;color:#141922!important;max-width:185px!important}
#how .step-modern p{position:absolute!important;left:14px!important;right:12px!important;bottom:14px!important;margin:0!important;font-size:13px!important;line-height:1.3!important;color:#7d8794!important;max-width:190px!important}

@media (max-width:768px){
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-shell{padding:16px 10px 12px!important;border-radius:24px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-shell::before{height:154px!important;background-position:center center!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-shell::after{top:88px!important;height:66px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero{margin-bottom:10px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero h2{font-size:26px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-showcase-hero p{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:4px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tabs{gap:8px!important;margin-bottom:10px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab{min-height:108px!important;padding:10px 5px 8px!important;border-radius:18px!important;gap:6px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .tab-icon{width:70px!important;height:50px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab>span:last-child{font-size:8.8px!important;max-width:78px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-panel{padding:12px!important;border-radius:18px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title h3{font-size:15px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title p{font-size:10px!important}
  #travelToolsShowcase #inlineCostBtn{height:48px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-radius:14px!important}

  #how.steps-modern{padding:16px 6px 8px!important}
  #how .steps-modern-head{margin-bottom:8px!important;gap:8px!important}
  #how .steps-modern-head h2{font-size:21px!important}
  #how .steps-modern-head p{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:4px!important}
  #how .steps-modern-head a{font-size:10px!important}
  #how .steps-modern-grid{gap:7px!important}
  #how .step-modern{height:118px!important;min-height:118px!important;padding:10px!important;border-radius:16px!important}
  #how .step-modern-num{left:10px!important;top:10px!important;width:28px!important;height:28px!important;font-size:12px!important}
  #how .step-modern-visual{right:7px!important;top:8px!important;width:42px!important;height:42px!important}
  #how .step-modern h4{left:10px!important;right:10px!important;bottom:31px!important;font-size:11px!important;max-width:96px!important}
  #how .step-modern p{left:10px!important;right:10px!important;bottom:10px!important;font-size:7.6px!important;line-height:1.22!important;max-width:100px!important}
}
</style>
<script id="v16-final-polish-script">
(function(){
  const costSvg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 92 64" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="tcost" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#79AFFF"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4E72FF"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x="28" y="4" width="36" height="56" rx="11" fill="url(#tcost)" opacity=".10"/><rect x="28" y="4" width="36" height="56" rx="11" fill="none" stroke="url(#tcost)" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="34" y="12" width="24" height="10" rx="3.5" fill="url(#tcost)" opacity=".33"/><circle cx="38" cy="31" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="46" cy="31" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="54" cy="31" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="38" cy="40" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="46" cy="40" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="54" cy="40" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="38" cy="49" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="46" cy="49" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/><circle cx="54" cy="49" r="2.8" fill="url(#tcost)"/></svg>';
  const advisorSvg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 92 64" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="tadv" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#C078FF"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8D52F7"/></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="46" cy="32" r="19" fill="url(#tadv)" opacity=".10"/><circle cx="46" cy="32" r="18" fill="none" stroke="url(#tadv)" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M55 22.5 49 35.5l-11 6 5-12.5 12-6.5Z" fill="url(#tadv)"/><circle cx="46" cy="32" r="4" fill="#fff" stroke="url(#tadv)" stroke-width="3"/></svg>';
  const adviceSvg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 92 64" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="tloc" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#48DEB2"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#22C78C"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M46 55.5s16-13.6 16-28.2c0-9.7-7.2-17.3-16-17.3s-16 7.6-16 17.3c0 14.6 16 28.2 16 28.2Z" fill="url(#tloc)" opacity=".14"/><path d="M46 55.5s16-13.6 16-28.2c0-9.7-7.2-17.3-16-17.3s-16 7.6-16 17.3c0 14.6 16 28.2 16 28.2Z" fill="none" stroke="url(#tloc)" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="46" cy="27.5" r="6" fill="url(#tloc)"/></svg>';
  const cardSvg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 92 64" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="tcard" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FF957E"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#F66B58"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x="22" y="12" width="48" height="32" rx="10" fill="url(#tcard)" opacity=".11"/><rect x="22" y="12" width="48" height="32" rx="10" fill="none" stroke="url(#tcard)" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M22 23h48" stroke="url(#tcard)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="31" y="29" width="16" height="6" rx="3" fill="url(#tcard)" opacity=".92"/></svg>';

  const step1Svg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="20" fill="#ffd8e1"/><path d="M20 56.5 35 49.5 47 54.5 61 48.5v17l-14 6-12-5-15 6Z" fill="#ffd3da" opacity=".95"/><path d="M35 49.5v17M47 54.5v17" stroke="#f0b0bb" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M50 44.5s12-10 12-22.5C62 12.8 56.6 8 50 8S38 12.8 38 22c0 12.5 12 22.5 12 22.5Z" fill="none" stroke="#ff7d90" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="50" cy="22" r="5.5" fill="#ff9aaa"/></svg>';
  const step2Svg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="20" fill="#dcebff"/><rect x="38" y="13" width="27" height="38" rx="9" fill="#eef5ff" stroke="#6ca6ff" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="48" cy="25" r="3.4" fill="#6ca6ff"/><circle cx="48" cy="34" r="3.4" fill="#6ca6ff"/><circle cx="48" cy="43" r="3.4" fill="#6ca6ff"/><path d="M55 25h10M55 34h10M55 43h10" stroke="#6ca6ff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>';
  const step3Svg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="20" fill="#d9f6df"/><rect x="39" y="18" width="28" height="20" rx="8" fill="#effcf3" stroke="#38c98f" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M39 26h28" stroke="#38c98f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="62" cy="50" r="12" fill="#38c98f"/><path d="m56.5 50 4.2 4.2 8.1-9.1" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>';

  const map = [
    ['#travelToolTabs [data-inline-tool="cost"] .tab-icon', costSvg],
    ['#travelToolTabs [data-inline-tool="advisor"] .tab-icon', advisorSvg],
    ['#travelToolTabs [data-inline-tool="advice"] .tab-icon', adviceSvg],
    ['#travelToolTabs [data-inline-tool="card"] .tab-icon', cardSvg],
    ['#inline-tool-cost .inline-tool-icon', costSvg],
    ['#inline-tool-advisor .inline-tool-icon', advisorSvg],
    ['#inline-tool-advice .inline-tool-icon', adviceSvg]
  ];
  map.forEach(([sel,svg])=>{const el=document.querySelector(sel);if(el) el.innerHTML=svg;});
  const cardLabel = document.querySelector('#travelToolTabs [data-inline-tool="card"] .tool-label-short'); if(cardLabel) cardLabel.textContent='Travel card generator';
  const cardPanelTitle = document.querySelector('#inline-tool-card .trip-card-brand'); if(cardPanelTitle) cardPanelTitle.textContent='LIVDAR TRAVEL CARD';

  const s1=document.querySelector('#how .step-modern.one .step-modern-visual'); if(s1) s1.innerHTML=step1Svg;
  const s2=document.querySelector('#how .step-modern.two .step-modern-visual'); if(s2) s2.innerHTML=step2Svg;
  const s3=document.querySelector('#how .step-modern.three .step-modern-visual'); if(s3) s3.innerHTML=step3Svg;
})();
</script>
<style id="v17-remaining-fixes">
/* V17 - fix only the remaining visual problems shown in the screenshots */
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab .tab-icon,
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title .inline-tool-icon{
  position:relative!important;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;overflow:visible!important;padding:0!important;
  background-repeat:no-repeat!important;background-position:center!important;background-size:contain!important;
}
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab .tab-icon::before,
#travelToolsShowcase .travel-tool-tab .tab-icon::after,
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title .inline-tool-icon::before,
#travelToolsShowcase .inline-tool-title .inline-tool-icon::after{content:none!important;display:none!important}
